<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Search Data Bench" description="Privacy information for Search Data Bench.">
<section class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Search Data Bench uses Cloudflare Web Analytics for privacy-focused traffic and performance measurement. Cloudflare Web Analytics collects page-view and performance information and is not used by Search Data Bench to track people across websites. The site can also emit local browser events when a reader follows a tracked outbound or affiliate link, but those custom click events are not currently stored by Search Data Bench.</p><p>Some outbound links are affiliate links. If you follow one, the destination provider may process referral information under its own privacy policy. Affiliate links are marked as sponsored in the page markup.</p><p>Our hosting and infrastructure providers may process ordinary technical request data needed to deliver and secure the site. If we enable additional persistent event measurement later, this page will be updated to describe that collection before we treat the resulting data as part of our experiment.</p><p>For our commercial relationship policy, see the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>